From: Conduit Windows driver
Subject: [PATCH] venus helios: defer small signal batches into one batch escape

Applies to winboat-org/mesa-helios @ 89bd0676a4e69740d9900fb13561b14acc4997d6 (src/virtio/vulkan/vn_renderer_helios.c).
Needs KMD >= 22.22.300.0 (HELIOS_ESCAPE_SUBMIT_VENUS_BATCH). Default OFF;
enable per process with HELIOS_SUBMIT_BATCH=1 (see guest/windows/icd/patches/README.md).
---
